---
// Two promise cards: light daily-brief card and navy engineer card.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="promise-header">
      <span class="ghost-rx" aria-hidden="true">Rx</span>
      <div class="promise-intro">
        <p class="eyebrow">What you get</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Medicine, not noise.</h2>
        <p class="prose">
          Most AI newsletters read like a firehose with ads. This one reads like a note from a
          colleague who spent the week building, and took five minutes to write down what worked.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="promise-grid">
      <article class="promise-card card-light">
        <p class="kicker">The weekly lesson</p>
        <h3 class="card-title">Five minutes, zero fluff.</h3>
        <p class="card-summary">
          One lesson a week, from a real project. What I built, what broke, and the takeaway worth
          keeping by lunch.
        </p>
        <ul class="card-list">
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>One lesson, told straight</h4>
              <p>No roundup of forty headlines. A single idea, pulled with context.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Opinions with receipts</h4>
              <p>If I say a benchmark is broken, I show the numbers that say so.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Skimmable by design</h4>
              <p>Read the bold lines on a busy morning, the whole thing on a slow one.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>

      <article class="promise-card card-navy">
        <div class="navy-kicker-row">
          <p class="kicker">Written by hand</p>
          <span class="badge">no AI slop</span>
        </div>
        <h3 class="card-title">From an engineer who ships.</h3>
        <p class="card-summary">
          Written by Rohith Perumandla, an AI/ML engineer with four years in the field. 2 SaaS
          platforms shipped, 3rd in build. Every claim is tested against real projects, not press
          releases.
        </p>
        <ul class="card-list">
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Practitioner first</h4>
              <p>LangGraph pipelines, RAG systems, fine-tuning runs. This letter lives in that world.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Learn in public</h4>
              <p>Wins and dead ends both get reported. You get the honest version.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="marker"></span>
            <div>
              <h4>Nothing to sell you</h4>
              <p>No course upsell, no affiliate links dressed up as analysis.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .section {
    padding-top: 110px;
  }
  .promise-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 30px;
  }
  .ghost-rx {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    color: #0b173121;
    user-select: none;
    flex: none;
    margin-top: 2px;
    font-size: 130px;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 0.8;
  }
  .promise-intro {
    max-width: 720px;
  }
  .promise-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: 20px;
    margin-top: 42px;
  }
  .promise-card {
    --card-copy: var(--ink-66);
    --card-rule: var(--hairline-soft);
    --marker-color: var(--orange);
    border-radius: 20px;
    min-width: 0;
    padding: 30px;
  }
  .card-light {
    border: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0, #ff950017, #0000 34%), #ffffffbd;
  }
  .card-navy {
    --card-copy: #ffffffad;
    --card-rule: #ffffff1f;
    --marker-color: var(--sheet-blue);
    color: var(--sheet-ink);
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 100% 0%, #0a7aff47, transparent 38%),
      linear-gradient(145deg, var(--navy-light), var(--navy));
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sheet);
    border: 1px solid #ffffff1a;
  }
  .kicker {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    letter-spacing: 1.2px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .card-light .kicker {
    color: var(--orange);
  }
  .card-navy .kicker {
    color: var(--sheet-blue);
  }
  .navy-kicker-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .badge {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    color: #fffc;
    letter-spacing: 0.7px;
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    background: #73b0ff24;
    border: 1px solid #73b0ff42;
    border-radius: 999px;
    flex: none;
    padding: 5px 8px;
  }
  .card-title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    letter-spacing: -0.4px;
    text-wrap: balance;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.18;
  }
  .card-summary {
    color: var(--card-copy);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 15px 0 0;
    font-size: 14.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }
  .card-list {
    border-top: 1px solid var(--card-rule);
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  .card-list li {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--card-rule);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 8px minmax(0, 1fr);
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 17px 0;
  }
  .card-list li:last-child {
    border-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }
  .marker {
    background: var(--marker-color);
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px color-mix(in srgb, var(--marker-color) 14%, transparent);
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-top: 6px;
  }
  .card-list h4 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    font-weight: 650;
    line-height: 1.35;
  }
  .card-list p {
    color: var(--card-copy);
    text-wrap: pretty;
    margin: 5px 0 0;
    font-size: 12.75px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }
  @media (width <= 760px) {
    .promise-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  @media (width <= 560px) {
    .ghost-rx {
      display: none;
    }
  }
  @media (width <= 420px) {
    .promise-card {
      padding: 24px 22px;
    }
    .card-title {
      font-size: 26px;
    }
    .navy-kicker-row {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
    }
  }
</style>
